# Web Module API
# Version: 2026.10.21_1

## Web Routes

### Main Pages

GET /
Redirects to /admin

GET /admin
Main administration dashboard (requires admin authentication)
Response: HTML page with dashboard

GET /admin/login
Login page for web console
Response: HTML page with login form

GET /admin/logout
Logout from web console
Response: Redirect to /admin/login

### Dashboard Pages

GET /admin/dashboard
Main dashboard with bot statistics and status
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/modules
List of all connected modules with status
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/modules/{module_name}
Configuration page for specific module
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/users
User management page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/users/{user_id}
Edit user page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/roles
Role management page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/menu
Menu configuration page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/llm
LLM configuration page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/multichat
Multi-chat configuration page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/datastore
Datastore configuration page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/apps
Apps management page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/settings
Global settings page
Response: HTML page

GET /admin/logs
System logs viewer
Response: HTML page

## API Endpoints

### Authentication

POST /api/v1/auth/login
Request: {"username": "string", "password": "string", "remember_me": "boolean"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

GET /api/v1/auth/status
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "authenticated|unauthenticated", "user": "object"}

POST /api/v1/auth/logout
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Modules Management

GET /api/v1/modules
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {
  "modules": [
    {
      "name": "string",
      "version": "string",
      "status": "active|inactive|error",
      "endpoints": ["array"],
      "health": "object"
    }
  ]
}

POST /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/start
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

POST /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/stop
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

POST /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/restart
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

GET /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"config": "object"}

POST /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"config": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### User Management

GET /api/v1/users
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Query params: page=number, limit=number, search=string
Response: {
  "users": ["array"],
  "total": "number",
  "page": "number",
  "limit": "number"
}

GET /api/v1/users/{user_id}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"user": "object"}

POST /api/v1/users
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"username": "string", "password": "string", "email": "string", "first_name": "string", "last_name": "string", "phone": "string", "roles": ["array"]}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "user_id": "string", "message": "string"}

PUT /api/v1/users/{user_id}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"username": "string", "email": "string", "first_name": "string", "last_name": "string", "phone": "string", "roles": ["array"], "status": "active|disabled"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

DELETE /api/v1/users/{user_id}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Role Management

GET /api/v1/roles
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"roles": ["array"]}

POST /api/v1/roles
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"name": "string", "description": "string", "permissions": ["array"]}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "role_id": "string", "message": "string"}

PUT /api/v1/roles/{role_id}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"name": "string", "description": "string", "permissions": ["array"]}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

DELETE /api/v1/roles/{role_id}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Menu Configuration

GET /api/v1/menu
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"menu": "object"}

POST /api/v1/menu
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"menu": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### LLM Configuration

GET /api/v1/llm/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"config": "object"}

POST /api/v1/llm/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"api_url": "string", "api_key": "string", "model": "string", "temperature": "number", "max_tokens": "number", "prompt_template": "string"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Multi-chat Configuration

GET /api/v1/multichat/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {
  "platforms": {
    "vk": {"enabled": "boolean", "token": "string", "config": "object"},
    "telegram": {"enabled": "boolean", "token": "string", "config": "object"},
    "max": {"enabled": "boolean", "token": "string", "config": "object"}
  }
}

POST /api/v1/multichat/config/{platform}
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"enabled": "boolean", "token": "string", "config": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Datastore Configuration

GET /api/v1/datastore/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {
  "datastores": [
    {
      "name": "string",
      "type": "string",
      "connection_string": "string",
      "config": "object"
    }
  ]
}

POST /api/v1/datastore/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"datastores": ["array"]}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Apps Management

GET /api/v1/apps
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {
  "apps": [
    {
      "name": "string",
      "version": "string",
      "status": "active|inactive",
      "config": "object"
    }
  ]
}

POST /api/v1/apps/{app_name}/enable
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

POST /api/v1/apps/{app_name}/disable
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

POST /api/v1/apps/{app_name}/config
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"config": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### System Status

GET /api/v1/system/status
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {
  "status": "healthy|degraded|unhealthy",
  "modules": ["array"],
  "uptime": "number",
  "memory_usage": "object",
  "cpu_usage": "number",
  "queue_size": "number"
}

GET /api/v1/system/metrics
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"metrics": "object"}

GET /api/v1/system/logs
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Query params: level=string, module=string, limit=number
Response: {"logs": ["array"]}

### Settings

GET /api/v1/settings
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Response: {"settings": "object"}

POST /api/v1/settings
Headers: Cookie: session_id=string
Request: {"settings": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Static Files

GET /static/*
Serves static files (CSS, JS, images)

## Webhook Endpoints (for module communication)

POST /api/v1/webhook/core
Receives notifications from core module
Request: {"event": "string", "data": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error"}

POST /api/v1/webhook/auth
Receives authentication events
Request: {"event": "string", "user_id": "string", "data": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error"}

## Error Codes
- 100: Invalid credentials
- 101: Session expired
- 102: Insufficient permissions
- 200: Invalid request data
- 201: Resource not found
- 202: Resource already exists
- 300: Module not found
- 301: Module not registered
- 302: Module error
- 400: Internal error
